       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. BATCH01.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-COUNT PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PROCEDURE.
           DISPLAY "START BATCH01".
           CALL "SUBPROG1" USING WS-COUNT.
           PERFORM CALC-SECTION.
           CALL "LOGGER" USING "BATCH01 DONE".
           STOP RUN.
       CALC-SECTION.
           ADD 1 TO WS-COUNT.
           PERFORM OUTPUT-SECTION.
       OUTPUT-SECTION.
           DISPLAY "RESULT: " WS-COUNT.
